 # Aegis Golden Path (v1)
 
+## Aegis Agent (ops + ML + compliance) patch
+
+This patch adds an **Agent Control Plane**:
+- DB tables:
+  - `agent_tasks`
+  - `agent_steps`
+- API endpoints:
+  - POST `/v1/agent/tasks`
+  - GET  `/v1/agent/tasks/{task_id}`
+- Out-of-process worker:
+  - `python -m api.golden_agent_controller_main`
+- Helm Deployment:
+  - `aegis-agent`
+
+### Safe tool registry
+This patch includes a small allowlisted tool registry (`api/golden_agent_tools.py`), but the main
+workflow is implemented directly for correctness and simplicity in v1.
+
+### One complete autonomous workflow (end-to-end)
`workflow.unified_autonomy` does:
+1) (ML) verifies canary model version passed offline eval (`eval_status=pass`)
+2) (OPS) creates a rollout (stable + canary) and boots the rollout controller a few ticks
+3) (OPS) generates usage summary
+4) (COMPLIANCE) exports a compliance bundle to S3
+
+To create a task, you must provide constraints JSON including:
+- `stable_deployment_id`
+- `canary_deployment_id`
+- optional `policy_name`, `policy_config`, `usage_days`, `compliance_days`
+
+Migrations:
+```bash
+alembic upgrade head
+```
+
 ## Autonomy ops patch: controller deployment + SLO/safety signals + infra scaffolds
